    --><script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-4713151443555790" crossorigin="anonymous"></script><title>Ollama Pull API SSRF CVE-2026-108836: Who Is Exposed</title><meta name="description" content="Ollama up to 0.34.1 has a pull API SSRF (CVE-2026-108836) with a public exploit. Medium severity, not in KEV. Who is exposed and how to fix it."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"><meta name="googlebot" content="index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1"><link rel="canonical" href="https://threatfrontier.com/articles/ollama-pull-api-ssrf-cve-2026-108836-exposed-servers-public-exploit"><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" href="https://threatfrontier.com/feed.xml"><link rel="alternate" type="text/markdown" href="https://threatfrontier.com/articles/ollama-pull-api-ssrf-cve-2026-108836-exposed-servers-public-exploit/llms.txt"><meta property="og:title" content="Ollama Pull API SSRF CVE-2026-108836: Who Is Exposed"><meta property="og:description" content="Ollama up to 0.34.1 has a pull API SSRF (CVE-2026-108836) with a public exploit. Medium severity, not in KEV. Who is exposed and how to fix it."><meta property="og:url" content="https://threatfrontier.com/articles/ollama-pull-api-ssrf-cve-2026-108836-exposed-servers-public-exploit"><meta property="og:site_name" content="ThreatFrontier.com"><meta property="og:locale" content="en_US"><meta property="og:type" content="article"><meta property="og:image" content="https://threatfrontier.com/api/media/media-11774cd4-d065-47b6-9767-2d915917d232-poster?width=wide"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="Data graphic: Ollama pull API SSRF CVE-2026-108836 , CVSS v4.0 Medium score 5.5 v3.1 scores it 7.3 High . Affects Ollama up to 0.34.1, fixed in 0.34.2, 0.35.0+ recommended because of CVE-2026-103663. Public exploit, not in CISA KEV."><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="670"